Prompt 7: Competitor Analysis

01. Prompt Text
Version 2.0 (Final Tested Prompt)
Used to generate competitive intelligence for GrowthPilot AI by analysing competitor strengths, weaknesses, customer objections, and differentiation opportunities.
The prompt separates verified market facts from assumptions to support sales positioning.

02. Intended Workflow / Task
Supports sales preparation before customer meetings and competitive discussions.
Used by sales teams to improve objection handling and positioning strategies.

03. Problem Being Solved
Reduces manual competitor research effort and improves sales readiness.
Improves:
Competitive positioning
Customer objection handling
Sales conversation quality

04. Automation Potential
Medium-high automation potential.
AI can summarise competitor information and identify possible differentiation strategies.
Human validation is required for:
Market accuracy
Competitive claims
Strategic positioning decisions

05. Risks & Limitations
Potential risks:
Outdated competitor information influencing sales decisions
Incorrect comparisons creating misleading claims
Failure to identify competitor strengths
Mitigation:
Validate important competitor information
Update research regularly
Use AI insights as preparation support rather than confirmed facts


